Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.33,0:01:07.32,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,用心中的橡皮拭去眼泪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.08,0:01:12.45,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.88,0:01:12.10,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Metamorphose！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.30,0:01:16.72,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,为梦想而生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.54,0:01:15.91,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,One！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.17,0:01:16.57,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Two！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.94,0:01:17.74,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Four！Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.97,0:01:22.10,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,飞翔吧 努力的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.08,0:01:21.40,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.65,0:01:22.05,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Four！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.45,0:01:23.29,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Two！One！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.35,0:01:27.81,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,未来不是只论成败
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.15,0:01:31.23,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,描绘自己的明天吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.71,0:01:33.11,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.02,0:01:34.48,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,GoGo！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.08,0:01:37.06,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go Go Go Go！Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.53,0:01:36.03,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,转危为机 坚强地变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.62,0:01:40.00,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
